t(19, 200, """very much that day; so the vision shortly before dawn was a consolation, and what a beautiful consolation: attending the birth of Allah's prophet Yusuf in ancient times, seeing him when he was born and beholding his captivating beauty as an infant. Just carrying him and looking at his face was one of the most beautiful moments of my life; a beautiful, beautiful child, unbelievably beautiful.""")

t(19, 645, """By Allah, besides whom there is no god and no lord, devils appear to me on internet channels .. By Allah, human devils .. preaching to people .. or claiming that they teach people .. or saying to people: we give you knowledge .. while they are real devils, for certain, without doubt, suspicion or illusion .. O people, hold yourselves above this .. Beware, for the calamity has become grave indeed, the blow has become ruin upon ruin, Satan has loosened his own halter, and his anger at our father Adam has subsided and his heart has cooled!""")

t(19, 1170, """Everything ((that has no)) explicit, clear, established Shar'i proof from the Book and authentic Sunnah, and every ijtihad ((not based)) on an analogy resting on a comparable Shar'i proof, near or far .. all this is falsehood which we throw against the wall and pay no mind .. our hands do not tremble .. and we do not care about those who hover around the fire of deceit and falsehood like moths around fire. For you will find among these chicks following chicks, in rotten eggs that almost never run out, and you will find armies of ignoramuses sitting before cameras .. armies of ignoramuses claiming to offer people knowledge .. armies of ignoramuses living the illusion of knowledge and righteousness, believing themselves and believed by every ignoramus! Know, may Allah have mercy on you, that the truth is not hard to grasp with the heart, for by it man comprehends right and wrong. If it is obscured from you, hold to the trustworthy, ((not to those)) whose misguidance is established for you, and about whom clear signs have settled in your souls that they are people of innovation and fitnah in creed and religion. It is only a market, and you are in it today; soon you will be rid of it and it of you. These are the last breaths this global satanic market is exhaling, a death rattle surging in the chest of this sinful market! This market whose roads mankind has entered, and which left no house without tempting and slapping it; houses among those who went astray, and how many they are, and houses among those who stood firm, and Allah knows best how few they are. Whoever wants safety should not enter all the roads of this market, and should content himself with a good in which his heart has settled; for the fitnah is present, deceit is general, spreading spark by spark, and the stench of the market has left no nose without giving it a cold: a nose that smells, and a nose that has been struck so it smells nothing! So reason, reason; wisdom, wisdom; caution, caution.""")

t(19, 2215, """Except the righteous
When some “cars of old” were made with a headlight that closed over to protect it when the car was switched off, that touch was one of the expressions of the man of that age, a man who still saw that life holds what frightens, and what calls for closing in on oneself to protect oneself from that frightening thing. In our time and age, man has broken loose in heart, tongue, hand and foot, and no longer goes about the earth as a human being, but as a coward, or as a vile one, or as a slave who has fled from everything Allah Almighty has enjoined on him. Except the righteous.""")

t(20, 1365, """Whoever is like this knows himself well, even if he is hit with a thousand accusations .. my Muslim brother .. my Muslim sister .. if you two are like this, pay no heed to the human devils, even if their beards are long, whatever commendation has been said of them, and though they describe you with every ugly thing; pay no heed to any of them, for these are human devils in the garb of worshippers who know nothing of religion but worship. As for their minds, they do not watch what the heart utters, not the tongue; for the one that speaks, always and forever, is the heart. As for the tongue, Allah's prophet Musa, peace be upon him, used to get angry though he was a prophet .. but he did no wrong despite his anger .. he punished over truth and falsehood without leniency, mercy or pity. These are important words for brothers and sisters of whose circumstances I know much .. here on the channel they have commented a lot on various topics .. I know their pain .. and I understand what they went through .. some told me, and some I see their pain in their comments. So if you, my Muslim brother / sister, see emptiness on your right and on your left, even if in that emptiness a thousand thousand adornments of this world really stood before your eyes, yet it is as though you really see emptiness .. as though you see nothing; then you look into your chest and see in it, with complete certainty, a heart that, when it sees someone healthy and well, is glad for him and wishes him more health; when it sees a rich man, is glad for him and wishes him more wealth and provision; when it sees a handsome young man, is glad for him and wishes that Allah Almighty preserve his youth for him; when told “so-and-so is richer than you” says “O Allah, give him more and bless him”; when told “so-and-so married someone more beautiful than your wife” says “O Allah, make them both happy, bless them, and make their home among the calmest and most serene of homes”; and when told “so-and-so has a palace and you have a flat” says “O Allah, give him instead of the palace two palaces, three, and five!”

If you are like this, my Muslim brother / sister, then know that everyone who accuses you of evil is misguided and a human devil, certainly and assuredly, not possibly; even if it is said of him that he is the most righteous of the people of the earth, he is a human devil""")

t(20, 2530, """“Is he whose evil deed has been made fair-seeming to him, so that he sees it as good...?”""")

t(21, 390, """A few minutes on the policy of systematic international propaganda - An article that is the product of a vision, like everything I publish here without exception; it is not an invention, nor copied from anywhere! We have been afflicted with those empty of mind and spirit among the kids of the internet - This was a historic week in the number of people blocked on the channel; one of them, perhaps two years ago, was saying on his channel that I copy internet content and paste it on my channel 😀

Now to what matters; the article may clear up some ambiguity about “the media of the future” in the context of international politics

Soft power, in the system of dismantling and rebuilding the mental image held by the other side (usually an enemy representing a state of conflict), rests on a theory to which I give a name of my own that I find clearest and easiest: (sector propaganda), in which one, two or three sectors, according to the state's strength in those sectors, are turned into a state of subjection to systematic, planned media saturation, so that systematic propaganda covers the other weak points in the rest of the state's sectors and presents the marketed sector through deliberate exaggeration, especially when other states lack the ability to dismantle the sector's information structure or breach its governmental protective walls. This becomes more successful in the absence of advanced smart technology and internet technology, and with the world's states returning to rely on individuals loyal to them on the ground to monitor what information is possible. Systematic propaganda succeeds when the internal security tools are effective and able to tighten their grip on the flow of information.""")

t(21, 2530, """The kings, sultans and emperors of the world, ancient and modern, never sat with a twisted arm and one shoulder thrust ahead of the other! Emperors, kings and sultans did not do it! But with a chair for 1000 pounds and a phone camera for maybe 7000""")

t(22, 150, """pounds, some individuals in society think they own the heavens and the earth. One of them sits, he who relieves himself like all humans, a weak creature whom a speck of dust in his throat could kill, or a leftover crumb of a biscuit the mouth did not chew well, and who may have spent half his life on hospital beds, always telling people “pray for me, I am tired!”; yet he transgresses and forgets the moment his health improves!! So he sits that tyrant's sitting, one shoulder thrust ahead of the other, looking at people with sharpness in his eyes, one arm back and one arm forward! He mocks this one and bullies that one!! Had a king done it we would say: a king, sultan and emperor who was given a great dominion; but with a plastic chair and a camera?! You feel that the one sitting before you presents himself as a god on earth, not even as an emperor. He gets angry at someone and calls him a donkey, another mentally retarded, a third contemptible, and his tongue utters foul words .. all this with a plastic chair and a camera? Had you been given a dominion, what would you do? What would you make? If a plastic chair and a camera did all this to you?! Ugly the act and ugly the deed, by Allah.""")

t(22, 1000, """Among the greatest injustice: slander and accusation where they do not belong, without evidence or proof, merely from suspicion, imagining and analysis!

Among the ugliest kinds of striving: harassing one who minds his own business!

Among the worst kinds of bad character: sitting on a seat with a crooked shoulder and a twisted arm, by one who thinks he will tear through the earth and reach the mountains in height!""")

t(22, 1545, """The West is not the real enemy of the Ummah. The real and first enemy of the Ummah is from among the Muslims themselves. Those with infinitesimally small minds! The huge skull inside which lies an infinitesimally small lentil grain, dreaming and imagining that its size is the size of the whole universe!! Those with sick hearts! Those whose souls know no good except through acting before people and claiming religiosity! These are the real enemy of the Ummah. These are the enemy. These are the ones who have penetrated among us .. in every street, every neighborhood and every institution! They slip in among us in the mosques and at Friday prayers, bowing and prostrating with us! Fasting with us! Making Hajj with us! And hiding everything! But Allah Almighty will expose all their hidden things, Allah willing, until not a single fig leaf remains to cover them.""")

t(22, 2215, """Last post for the ignorant Abu Abdurrahman (claimant to Mahdihood) .. a post that concludes my reply to this ignorant harasser .. what has not been said about him is many times the disasters and calamities that have been said .. so I will consider the reply finished (if you pull yourself together) .. Pull yourself together, or else .. or else a new stage will begin with audio recordings that will leave none of your faults unexposed to people! You do not realize the magnitude of what you undertook in harassing a man who, with his partners in this gathering, is busy with everything beneficial, by our Lord's grace. Harassment is a crime that does not pass with me.

I am a weak servant to Allah alone, but to people I am not weak when they act tyrannically, haughtily, arrogantly and unjustly; I have never been weak before people and never will be. Enough of your pipe dreams; your videos scream your haughtiness, but keep this haughtiness to yourself.""")

t(23, 160, """What you know about me = [zero] .. and if the devil of your soul incites you, then try more .. and harass more .. We come down to the level of those like you who harass people, because those like you understand only this language .. we come down to the level of your morals, and the level of your shallow, polluted thinking, until we are sure that your mind has grasped and that you have absorbed the message!""")

t(24, 670, """Finishing touches of the end of 2025 - Women's guile and the harasser Abu Abdurrahman (Ahmad) - A fifth column hidden inside our Ummah - His method is personal and subjective, driven by his whims and the inclinations of a soul he has not purified - He speaks on public affairs with ignorance and folly

When women's guile takes hold in males, do not ask about the absurdity and farce .. While we here, by the grace of our Great Lord, are constantly giving glad tidings and good news and spreading what is beneficial, by the grace of our Lord, sanctified be His names; all of us here in this gathering together, in a joint effort, raising the morale of Muslims, men and women, in a real counter-war against what the enemies of the homelands and of the Ummah want by spreading despair and shattering Muslims' morale; while we are absorbed in that, far from playing with beard hair, far, by our Great Lord's grace, from ignorance and spreading it, far from trivialities and from what the ignorant offer; women's guile takes hold in some males merely because of a picture that is published!! While one of them plays with his beard hair in front of the camera daily, not missing a day without appearing to play with his beard hair, and gazing long at the camera as though it were speaking and talking to him! If a mere picture brought out women's guile in a male among males, then say of a segment in our Ummah, few Allah willing: bid them farewell and wash your hands and feet of them, and expect from them no chivalry, manhood or values. A message to the one in whom women's guile has taken hold, and to whoever the YouTuber is who advised him to harass me and goaded him to it as devils goad! He knows who his companion is that ruined him! My ear-pinch is not slight or easy. And yes, this is a gathering of knowledge, but it is also a gathering of war on the human devils, the people of evil, so that they are deterred and disciplined by force, not willingly; because the likes of these (fear but have no shame).""")

t(25, 325, """“Or do those in whose hearts is a disease think that Allah will never bring their malice to light?”""")

t(25, 1825, """The disguised claimant to Mahdihood (Ahmad), known as Abu Abdurrahman!

4 years ago he interprets a vision on his channel, saying in explanation of it: the Mahdi's name is Ahmad, brown-skinned, from Egypt, his hair shiny; and these are his very own traits in that very episode (his hair in the episode was shiny), so people comment to him laughing: you're talking about yourself!

(Many), not ((all)); many of the channels that talk about Mahdi visions, specialize in Mahdi visions, whose daily preoccupation is Mahdi visions and which offer nothing but Mahdi visions, are owned by claimants to Mahdihood, ignorant to a terrifying degree!

Except the people of sound mind among the owners of honorable, balanced channels""")

t(26, 150, """The profiteer who earns by trickery, Abu Abdurrahman, owner of a vision-interpretation channel

He asks the sheikh who connects with him to pray, by name, for those who pay money to the channel; prayer in exchange for payment! Then he has boasted for more than 5 years, saying “I work for Allah”!!! And for the rest of the viewers he prays in general without mentioning their names!

Pay and we pray for you by name!
Don't pay and we pray for you in bulk!

Even if you change your style after this post, you will not change what we have recorded against you of your stipulating to that sheikh and deceiving him""")

t(26, 1000, """The ignorant Abu Abdurrahman, owner of a vision-interpretation channel - a gatherer of wood by night in the science of vision interpretation, a greedy, voracious profiteer; that his work is for Allah is a lie before all witnesses; rather it is work for this world and money, profiteering, love of fame and love of playing with his beard hair!

🔴 Corrupt in creed; no Shar'i knowledge is taken from him
🔴 Corrupt in method of interpretation; no vision interpretation is taken from him
🔴 A heretic; no logic is taken from him
🔴 Corrupt in thought; no thought is taken from him, for his great ignorance of history and culture
🔴 Corrupt in knowledge; he does not even know the details of the reality he lives in
🔴 A profiteer; no channel owner trading on end-times channels trades as much as he does, regardless of his earnings, even if small or nil. I have been told that if his episode is an hour, then half an hour of it he plays with his beard hair to lengthen the episode for the ads, a quarter hour he begs people for likes and shares, a quarter hour he humiliates people, telling them “I am tired; you do not know how much toil we put in”, a quarter hour he looks at the camera silent, not speaking, as if looking at a ghost he saw, a quarter hour he thanks those who send money, then leaves 5 minutes to present content, and at his best presents a quarter hour of content! I do not know how he does all that in an hour .. madness the like of which we have not heard of on a channel.""")

t(26, 2040, """Ignorance has no cure - A reply to the ignorant use of my voice from my latest recording by an ignoramus who has a YouTube channel, named Abu Abdurrahman

A commentary reached me, which I listened to, on the vision I published in my voice two days ago, made by one of the owners of vision-interpretation channels. Had he not taken my audio clip and displayed it I would not have commented on his ignorance, but the harassment of me seems very clear, since the vision was published by many others besides me on YouTube. It seems he does not know what it means to harass me, but now he will know.

His commentary is of course full of great ignorance of interpretation, as though he had no connection at all with the science of interpretation; how many an interpreter has had the science of interpretation stripped from him! For this ignoramus said that the Prophet ﷺ cannot embrace any woman in any vision! This is great ignorance, and unfortunately this is what happens when the matter is entrusted to those unfit for it. The realm of the Barzakh has nothing to do with the realm of reality and the witnessed realm. His words that the Prophet ﷺ does not embrace a non-mahram woman are true, but that is in the witnessed realm; the witnessed realm is one thing, and the realm of visions (the Barzakh) is another, different thing,""")

t(27, 150, """but it is clear that this ignoramus does not understand the difference between the realm of the Barzakh, which is not governed by Islamic legislation with its many known rulings, nor governed by logic, nor custom, nor even what is deemed acceptable among the habitual things of the real world.

Then this ignoramus in vision interpretation says: the Prophet ﷺ speaks only in the Hijri calendar because he used it in his time. Here is ignorance of interpretation with ignorance of history and its events added to it!!! Ignorance of two matters together is what I mentioned about (when the matter is entrusted to those unfit for it): ignoramuses come out to people, issuing fatwas to them and speaking on public affairs; and vision interpretation is a fatwa, but it seems this news has not reached him! This ignoramus continues: had you looked at the letters the Prophet ﷺ used to send (he means to the Romans, Persians and Copts), you would have seen that the letters bore the Hijri date!!! Ignorance of a kind the mind cannot imagine! When a person is at this level of ignorance of history and its events, how does he take the lead in vision interpretation and speak on public affairs?

Then he says: had you looked at the Arab states you would have seen that most Arab states deal by the Hijri calendar! Though this is the exact opposite of reality, and a small child knows that!!

🔴 Ignorance of interpretation
🔴 Ignorance of history and what happened in it
🔴 Ignorance of the lived reality that a child grasps

And this same ignoramus has been repeating for years:
Al-Khidr is alive, provided for, moving about the earth to this day! So I say to this ignoramus: he moves about, alive and provided for, but was too lazy to go to Madinah to believe in the Prophet ﷺ and meet him!!!!!!

🔴 Spreading superstitions

And this same ignoramus used to repeat:
The soul of Ibrahim, son of the Prophet ﷺ, will dwell in the Mahdi's body when the Mahdi is born, and the Mahdi carries the very soul of Ibrahim as compensation to the Prophet ﷺ for his son's death as a child!!

🔴 Transmigration of souls (corrupt creed)""")

t(28, 775, """One of the brothers wrote to me a few days ago saying: I heard you are ill, which is why you do not appear in sound and picture. I do not know the reason for that, but perhaps whoever spread this rumor is a hater. The picture is from 5 minutes ago, and so that things are not confused, I never dye my hair, absolutely, at all; the blackness in the hair, without cause, began a while ago. So that no argument arises with me in the comments about my dyeing, for I am not among those who encourage dyeing, because what Allah Almighty wills is more beautiful: if He wills grey for you it is more beautiful, and if He wills black for you it is more beautiful.

Unfortunately I do not like posting a picture, because I receive backbiting and insinuation, from someone who is supposed to fear Allah and be mindful of Him, with the accusation of setting up spotlights; but beautiful patience. I say to him: I switched off the light of the second room and left only one light, so that perhaps what your soul dislikes will not appear in the picture!

In general, necessity required refuting what is rumored about seclusion because of illness, refuge is sought in Allah Almighty.""")

t(29, 1605, """Comparisons you have not heard before

Everyone who claims what is not rightfully his has a moment of terror .. The First A'idh in the realm of the Barzakh when he saw the Second A'idh; this took place in (the realm of the Barzakh) - the realm of visions; it reached me years ago, I do not recall the timing, perhaps 7 or 10 years ago .. and the Dajjal when he sees the Messiah, peace be upon him, face to face in the witnessed realm (reality), not the realm of the Barzakh - not the realm of visions

Two faces for four central figures at the end of history
Two A'idhs meet ((in the realm of the Barzakh)) and the first looks at the second in intense terror .. and a false messiah and the true Messiah, peace be upon him, meet ((in the witnessed realm)) and the false one looks at Allah's prophet Isa in intense terror!

🔴 The First A'idh is killed because his role has ended; Allah Almighty did not wrong him, and he is a Muslim
🔴 The Messiah Dajjal is killed because his role has ended; Allah Almighty did not wrong him, and he is a disbeliever

🔴 The First A'idh is of the Ummah of the Second A'idh
🔴 The Messiah Dajjal is of the Ummah of the true Messiah, peace be upon him

🔴 As for the First A'idh, his terror is not necessarily because he erred deliberately, but because of his certainty in the realm of the Barzakh that he had trespassed on a station that was not his, out of ignorance on his part; when he saw in the realm of the Barzakh the reality of the station, he trembled with indescribable terror ..

🔴 As for the Dajjal, when he sees the Messiah face to face he melts, before a piece of his leg remains, full of blood, its end bleeding and its flesh exposed. He melts only because he trespassed on the station of Allah's prophet Isa when he claimed to be him, then deified himself on""")

t(30, 150, """earth, claiming divinity

So between the First A'idh and the Second A'idh the meeting was in the realm of the unseen (the Barzakh), and between the Dajjal and the Messiah, peace be upon him, the meeting will be in the realm of the seen (the world we live in)

As for the meeting of the First A'idh and the Second A'idh being in the realm of the unseen and not in the witnessed realm, one of its aspects is that the whole case of the First and Second A'idhs is a case whose episodes unfolded in the realm of the Barzakh (visions)!

Whereas the whole case of the Dajjal and the Messiah, peace be upon him, is a case that unfolded in the witnessed realm (the real world), in the Dajjal's actual domination over mankind (on the ground of reality) and his actual corruption on earth in the realm of reality.

The First and Second A'idh are a disputed case that heaven settles through the realm of visions before the conflict is settled on the ground of reality. The Dajjal and the Messiah, peace be upon him, are a disputed case that heaven settles through the decrees of the witnessed realm directly, without the realm of visions dominating the matter.

That is why, for 20 years, we find a wide spread of the realm of visions (the Barzakh) in the case of the Second A'idh
and we find very few visions giving glad tidings of the nearness of the coming of Allah's prophet Isa, peace be upon him

The war between the Second A'idh and the Dajjal has always been a hidden war, in secret .. then it will move to the realm of reality with the appearance of the Second A'idh, who will challenge the Dajjal's dominance over the earth for some years and achieve great accomplishments against that dominance .. But because the Dajjal's end is not at the hands of a figure for whom visions were the center of people's knowledge of him (the Second A'idh), the Dajjal's end is at the hands of a figure whose case visions did not dominate (the Messiah, peace be upon him)

And since visions dominated the case of the Second A'idh, his long war with the Dajjal was in the realm of the Barzakh; and so the seven, eight or nine years are years in which the Second A'idh uses many unseen (heavenly) powers, not only earthly powers, to curb the unruliness of the Dajjal's global wings, especially the (Western) ones. The Second A'idh remains empowered with those powers until Allah Almighty lifts them, for His wisdom, sanctified be His names, after Muslims finish accomplishing their final civilizational project of presenting true Islam to mankind, and after the proofs are established against the nations of the earth; so that no nation says on the Day of Resurrection “no news came to us of a true religion whose people represent it in the finest way”, for on that day (the Day of Resurrection) they will not be able to say that. It is not as today, when one of them may come on the Day of Resurrection and say: I did not embrace Islam because the Muslims I saw before I died used to lie, swindle and kill the soul Allah has forbidden to be killed; and these are arguments. As for the nations that will witness the second and final universality of Islam, they will not find that way out!

So the Second A'idh's project is presenting Islam in the most beautiful form. After the mission ends, the mission will have fulfilled its role. After the mission ends, the Dajjal comes out so that the chapters of life on earth come to an end, in order that he be killed; then the system of the major signs of the Hour begins to accelerate, at a pace whose reality none knows but Allah the Great, our Lord, sanctified be His names, magnified in the heavens and on earth, and exalted in great exaltation.""")

t(31, 1235, """The Earth is not a cosmic speck of dust. This is a wrong statement""")

t(31, 1455, """An imagined picture for understanding how to solve (part of) the housing problem in the Islamic world. People going to China to contract for buying prefabricated houses, to get China's factories moving so that their wheels turn again, and to transfer some of those factories to us .. China was and still is the world's factory for thousands of years .. Many people think China has been manufacturing for only 50 years! History is something else. China has manufactured more than any other nation on the face of the earth for thousands of years.""")

t(32, 715, """A word to homes and families, and a piece of advice
May Allah protect every home from seeking the father's / mother's approval by attacking the elder brother. The cases are many, and it always happens suddenly without the victim noticing, and in 90% of cases at the instigation of the younger brother's wife and his mother-in-law, who are jealous of the elder brother's central place in the family; so shameful plots are woven and wrongs are committed. Fathers and mothers in this matter are of kinds and types: aware and mature ones, and unaware ones who are dragged behind sick aims and even cooperate with the younger brother in destroying the elder brother's standing when the younger brother is the one giving the money.

All these are deeds of iblises and devils, who confuse fathers, mothers and the brothers younger in age in every word, act and deed, and guide them to what is not right to say or do; so injustice occurs, offence occurs, and people are afflicted with pain and hurt!

Years ago a vision reached me, seen by someone (I know him) about his younger brother: he saw him wearing his good clothes, such as formal jackets. The seer thought his younger brother would become like him, especially as at that time he was living through a great failure in his life, so the seer was glad for his younger brother. Then the years pass and doors are opened for the younger brother; he grows haughty and arrogant, weaves plots and showers his siblings with money to craft an image through which he can cancel the elder brother's presence. This too is a word to homes and families (to the siblings) in every home and every family: money is not everything. Today there is money, but tomorrow there is none, for life does not stay at the same pace. As for cutting ties of kinship and despising the elder because he has no money, this is a form of sanctifying the one with money even if he is younger in age!

I had not dealt with this issue before, but a video recording that appeared to me by decree reminded me of it. It is one of the causes of the ruin of the life of families and households; had people feared their Lord they would not have fallen into such trials. For the approval of fathers and mothers is not won by disobeying Allah Almighty and spreading corruption on earth. In most of the cases I know, this evil deed turned into its opposite: neither the father nor the mother was pleased; rather they became an even greater bane to everyone, because fundamentally their method as fathers and mothers is corrupt, and their life is built on money, matter and love of this world, not on right and wrong. In many cases fathers and mothers take part in humiliating the elder brother in front of all his siblings, and trample on him deliberately to flatter a younger brother who gives them money! By Allah, there is no wisdom in this at all; so breasts fill with rancor, ties of kinship are severed, and the father and mother become two agents of corruption on earth.

The issue of the younger brother and the elder brother is, most regrettably, a very recurrent one and will remain recurrent; since it has been mentioned in the Book of Allah Almighty, this means that it is unfortunately a part of the life of many people, who live it, and in it are practiced deeds and words that do not please Allah Almighty. The experience of Allah's prophet Yusuf, peace be upon him, need not match the experiences we have witnessed and that reached me, nor the heart-bleeding stories that reached me; rather, in many experiences the father allies with the younger son, or the mother allies with the younger son in the family, purely to spite the elder son out of enmity to him, and they use the younger son to hurt the elder son! By Allah, these are neither fathers nor mothers, and by Allah, these are not homes of Islam and Muslims but homes in which devils graze. In the symbolism of Allah's prophet Yusuf, peace be upon him, he was the greater in rank and worth, being a prophet, while his brothers were older in age but lesser than him in rank and heavenly standing; yet it is a story that came to show a family context that need not match the stories we witness.""")

t(33, 340, """The Persian Muslims are returning, by Allah Almighty's leave, as an important component in the Ummah's future. This component, returning in the future, Allah Almighty willing, to the straight path, will be, by Allah Almighty's leave, a strong supporting element for the Ummah in all fields.""")

t(33, 1870, """We are approaching, Allah Almighty willing, the fulfilment of this noble hadith after 1407 years .. the embrace that was postponed and delayed for 1407 years .. The Prophet ﷺ said: ((“If religion were at the Pleiades, a man from Persia, or he said: from the sons of Persia, would go and take hold of it”)) .. the Persians joining the Arabs, the end of the fitnah of Shi'ism, and the fusing of the whole Ummah into one body, by the power of our Great Lord""")

t(34, 925, """The state of those who see the overwhelming signs and then disbelieve
The Lord of Might, sanctified be His names, says: “And those who were given the Scripture did not divide until after the clear proof had come to them” (4)

“Until after the clear proof had come to them” means the plain proof came to them. What is meant by it is Muhammad ﷺ; that is, the Qur'an, in agreement with what was in their hands of the Scripture, with his description and attribute. That is because they were united on his prophethood, and when he was sent they denied his prophethood and divided; some of them disbelieved out of transgression and envy, and some believed; like His saying, Exalted is He: “And they did not divide until after knowledge had come to them, out of transgression among themselves”""")

t(34, 1550, """“We will call the guards of Hell (18) No! Do not obey him; prostrate and draw near ۩ (19)”""")

t(34, 1845, """“A lying, sinful forelock (16)”""")

t(34, 2140, """“Does man think that We will not assemble his bones? (3) Yes indeed; We are able to restore even his fingertips (4) But man wants to go on sinning ahead of him”""")

t(34, 2485, """“Rather, man is a witness against himself (14) even if he offers his excuses (15)”""")

t(35, 340, """In the era of Muslims' discipline and their walking on the Prophetic method, the religious affairs sector cannot be corrected of what it is drowning in except through .. (The orders of the Ministry of Religious Affairs are not open to discussion .. every violation will be met with removal from work and judicial penalty) .. By the power of our Great Lord, a new era in which the chaos of fatwas ends, along with the age of the fluid religious discourse swinging right and left, and the phase of spreading hadiths of weak chain from the pulpits and promoting them to people as sound in chain, betrayal of the trust of knowledge, and lack of conscience (in some)""")

t(35, 1975, """Phones may turn into filming tools instead of cameras .. then photos and video are transferred onto memory cards and sent to TV channels and print newspapers; but most of this will not be useful to individuals, except those who will also regard phones as filming tools replacing the traditional camera, to upload what they filmed not to the internet (because it will not exist) but to computers, merely to watch it with the family as memories.""")

t(36, 2440, """The private-sector economy is expected to focus on partnerships between citizens and non-Muslim expatriates who are devoted to management and seeking investment opportunities in cities where electricity is free for the business sector""")
